<main class="team-page">
  <section class="team-hero">
    <div class="team-wrap team-hero-grid">
      <div class="team-intro">
        <p class="team-kicker"><span></span> THE PEOPLE BEHIND THE WORK</p>
        <h1>A team built around <em>the work.</em></h1>
        <p class="team-lead">Different perspectives. Different disciplines. One shared expectation: if something matters, we should be willing to do the work to make it better.</p>
        <a class="team-text-link" href="/company/careers-contact/">Explore careers &amp; contact <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="team-visual" role="img" aria-label="An abstract network of connected perspectives converging around a shared purpose">
        <div class="team-visual-grid"></div>
        <div class="team-orbit team-orbit-a"><i></i></div>
        <div class="team-orbit team-orbit-b"><i></i></div>
        <div class="team-orbit team-orbit-c"><i></i></div>
        <div class="team-core"><span>ONE SHARED</span><b>PURPOSE</b><i></i></div>
        <span class="team-node team-node-a">CURIOSITY</span>
        <span class="team-node team-node-b">OWNERSHIP</span>
        <span class="team-node team-node-c">EXECUTION</span>
        <small class="team-visual-foot">PERSPECTIVE <i></i> IN MOTION</small>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="team-wrap team-hero-bottom"><span>PEOPLE</span><i></i><span>PERSPECTIVE</span><i></i><span>DETERMINATION</span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="team-section team-principles">
    <div class="team-wrap">
      <div class="team-section-head">
        <p class="team-kicker">HOW WE COME TOGETHER</p>
        <h2>Good work needs more than <em>good ideas.</em></h2>
        <p>We value the qualities that move a difficult problem from a question to something real.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="team-principle-grid">
        <article class="team-principle">
          <span class="team-index">01 / MINDSET</span>
          <div class="team-glyph team-glyph-one"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          <h3>Curiosity</h3>
          <p>Question assumptions. Get close to the details. Stay open to changing direction when the evidence tells us to.</p>
          <b>ASK BETTER QUESTIONS</b>
        </article>
        <article class="team-principle">
          <span class="team-index">02 / COMMITMENT</span>
          <div class="team-glyph team-glyph-two"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          <h3>Ownership</h3>
          <p>Care about the problem beyond the brief. Take responsibility for the decisions, the details, and the outcome.</p>
          <b>TAKE RESPONSIBILITY</b>
        </article>
        <article class="team-principle">
          <span class="team-index">03 / PRACTICE</span>
          <div class="team-glyph team-glyph-three"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          <h3>Execution</h3>
          <p>Move between ideas and action. Test in the real world, learn from what happens, and keep improving.</p>
          <b>MAKE PROGRESS REAL</b>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="team-section team-approach">
    <div class="team-wrap team-approach-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="team-kicker">A SHARED STANDARD</p>
        <h2>Different strengths.<br/><em>One standard of work.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="team-approach-copy">
        <p>We challenge assumptions, get close to the details, and stay open to changing our minds when the evidence tells us to.</p>
        <p>We value people who can move between ideas and execution—people who don't just ask what is possible, but what is worth doing.</p>
        <a href="/company/">More about E Deviser <span>→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="team-wrap team-note">
      <span class="team-note-mark">E.</span>
      <div><small>ABOUT OUR PEOPLE</small><p>Individual team profiles will be published when names, roles, and biographies are confirmed. We won't invent people or credentials to fill a page.</p></div>
      <span class="team-note-status"><i></i> ACCURACY FIRST</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="team-close">
    <div class="team-wrap team-close-inner">
      <p class="team-kicker">BUILD WITH US</p>
      <h2>Bring your curiosity.<br/><em>Put it to work.</em></h2>
      <p>Explore how to connect with E Deviser and stay informed about future opportunities.</p>
      <a href="/company/careers-contact/">Careers &amp; Contact <span>↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<style>
.team-page{--tp-bg:#07121d;--tp-panel:#0b1b28;--tp-line:rgba(160,205,218,.16);--tp-text:#f3f8fb;--tp-muted:#a8bbc6;--tp-blue:#0382BD;--tp-teal:#5AB9B4;--tp-mint:#CDFCF4;background:var(--tp-bg);color:var(--tp-text);overflow:hidden}
.team-page *{box-sizing:border-box}.team-wrap{width:min( min(88rem,calc(100% - 3rem)),88rem);margin-inline:auto}
.team-hero{position:relative;padding:clamp(4rem,8vw,7.5rem) 0 2rem;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 78% 34%,rgba(3,130,189,.16),transparent 38%),linear-gradient(180deg,#081622 0%,#07121d 100%)}
.team-hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.9fr) minmax(25rem,1.1fr);gap:clamp(2rem,6vw,6rem);align-items:center;min-height:34rem}
.team-kicker{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem;margin:0 0 1.4rem;color:#83d2d0;font:600 .65rem/1.4 var(--font-mono,monospace);letter-spacing:.16em}
.team-kicker>span,.team-note-status i{width:.42rem;height:.42rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--tp-teal);box-shadow:0 0 13px #5ab9b4a6}
.team-intro h1,.team-section h2,.team-close h2{margin:0;color:var(--tp-text);font:700 clamp(3rem,5.8vw,6rem)/.98 var(--font-display,var(--font-body,sans-serif));letter-spacing:-.065em}
.team-intro h1 em,.team-section h2 em,.team-close h2 em{color:#76cbc9;font-style:normal}
.team-lead{max-width:38rem;margin:1.6rem 0 0;color:var(--tp-muted);font-size:clamp(1rem,1.3vw,1.15rem);line-height:1.85}
.team-text-link,.team-approach-copy a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:1.2rem;margin-top:2rem;color:#c0e2fd;text-decoration:none;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:650}
.team-text-link span,.team-approach-copy a span{color:var(--tp-teal);transition:transform .3s}
.team-text-link:hover span,.team-approach-copy a:hover span{transform:translate(3px,-3px)}
.team-visual{position:relative;min-height:31rem;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--tp-line);background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 48%,rgba(3,130,189,.2),transparent 42%),linear-gradient(145deg,#0c2230,#081522 65%,#0b1d28)}
.team-visual-grid{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:.26;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(192,226,253,.08) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(192,226,253,.08) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:42px 42px;mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,#000 20%,transparent 78%)}
.team-orbit{position:absolute;left:50%;top:48%;width:19rem;height:19rem;border:1px solid rgba(90,185,180,.32);border-radius:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(-24deg) scaleY(.48)}
.team-orbit-b{width:24rem;height:24rem;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(58deg) scaleY(.48);border-color:rgba(3,130,189,.5)}
.team-orbit-c{width:29rem;height:29rem;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(-62deg) scaleY(.48);border-color:rgba(192,226,253,.22)}
.team-orbit i{position:absolute;left:14%;top:14%;width:.55rem;height:.55rem;border-radius:50%;background:#cdfcf4;box-shadow:0 0 18px #5ab9b4}
.team-orbit-b i{left:auto;right:8%;top:48%;background:#0382bd}
.team-orbit-c i{left:48%;top:auto;bottom:9%;background:#c0e2fd}
.team-core{position:absolute;left:50%;top:48%;width:12rem;height:12rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.55rem;border:1px solid rgba(192,226,253,.38);border-radius:42% 58% 54% 46%/48% 42% 58% 52%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 28%,rgba(90,185,180,.28),transparent 55%),rgba(7,24,36,.92);box-shadow:0 0 70px rgba(3,130,189,.2),inset 0 0 35px rgba(90,185,180,.09);transform:translate(-50%,-50%);animation:team-morph 12s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
.team-core span,.team-core b{font-family:var(--font-mono,monospace);letter-spacing:.15em}.team-core span{font-size:.56rem;color:#9bbfc9}.team-core b{font-size:1.35rem;color:white}.team-core i{width:2.3rem;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#5ab9b4,transparent)}
.team-node{position:absolute;padding:.55rem .7rem;border:1px solid rgba(90,185,180,.28);background:rgba(7,20,31,.82);color:#c0e2fd;font:500 .56rem var(--font-mono,monospace);letter-spacing:.12em;backdrop-filter:blur(8px)}
.team-node-a{left:7%;top:23%}.team-node-b{right:6%;top:30%}.team-node-c{left:34%;bottom:13%}
.team-visual-foot{position:absolute;left:1.3rem;bottom:1.2rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem;color:#819eab;font:500 .53rem var(--font-mono,monospace);letter-spacing:.13em}.team-visual-foot i{width:2rem;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0382bd,#5ab9b4)}
.team-hero-bottom{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;padding-top:2rem;color:#7695a4;font:500 .58rem var(--font-mono,monospace);letter-spacing:.14em}.team-hero-bottom i{height:1px;flex:1;max-width:5rem;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0382bd,#5ab9b4)}
.team-section{padding:clamp(5rem,9vw,8rem) 0;border-top:1px solid var(--tp-line)}
.team-section-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .7fr;column-gap:5vw;align-items:end}.team-section-head .team-kicker{grid-column:1/-1}.team-section-head h2{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,4.8vw,4.8rem)}.team-section-head>p:last-child{max-width:27rem;margin:0 0 .4rem;color:var(--tp-muted);line-height:1.8}
.team-principle-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem;margin-top:3.5rem}
.team-principle{position:relative;min-height:23rem;padding:1.6rem;border:1px solid var(--tp-line);background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(15,39,53,.82),rgba(8,22,33,.88));transition:transform .35s,border-color .35s,background .35s}
.team-principle:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);border-color:rgba(90,185,180,.48);background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(16,48,62,.9),rgba(8,22,33,.94))}
.team-index{color:#80c8c9;font:500 .57rem var(--font-mono,monospace);letter-spacing:.12em}
.team-glyph{height:5rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.45rem;margin:1.3rem 0}
.team-glyph i{display:block;width:.7rem;border:1px solid #5ab9b4;border-radius:2rem;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#5ab9b4aa,#0382bd22);box-shadow:0 0 18px #0382bd30}
.team-glyph-one i:nth-child(1){height:1.5rem}.team-glyph-one i:nth-child(2){height:3rem}.team-glyph-one i:nth-child(3){height:2rem}
.team-glyph-two i:nth-child(1){height:2.2rem}.team-glyph-two i:nth-child(2){height:2.2rem;transform:translateY(-.7rem)}.team-glyph-two i:nth-child(3){height:2.2rem}
.team-glyph-three i:nth-child(1){height:1rem}.team-glyph-three i:nth-child(2){height:2rem}.team-glyph-three i:nth-child(3){height:3.2rem}
.team-principle h3{margin:0 0 .8rem;color:white;font-size:1.55rem;letter-spacing:-.04em}.team-principle p{max-width:34ch;margin:0;color:var(--tp-muted);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.8}.team-principle>b{position:absolute;left:1.6rem;bottom:1.5rem;color:#79c9c8;font:500 .55rem var(--font-mono,monospace);letter-spacing:.12em}
.team-approach{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#081622,#0a1a27)}
.team-approach-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .8fr;gap:8vw;align-items:center}.team-approach h2{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,4.8vw,4.8rem)}.team-approach-copy p{color:var(--tp-muted);line-height:1.9}.team-approach-copy p+p{margin-top:1rem}
.team-note{display:grid;grid-template-columns:4rem 1fr auto;align-items:center;gap:1.5rem;margin-top:5rem;padding:1.4rem 1.6rem;border:1px solid var(--tp-line);background:rgba(192,226,253,.025)}
.team-note-mark{display:grid;place-items:center;width:3.5rem;height:3.5rem;border:1px solid rgba(90,185,180,.35);border-radius:50%;color:#9fe0dc;font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:800}
.team-note small{color:#7fc9c9;font:500 .57rem var(--font-mono,monospace);letter-spacing:.12em}.team-note p{max-width:65ch;margin:.4rem 0 0;color:var(--tp-muted);font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.7}.team-note-status{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;color:#8ca9b5;font:500 .53rem var(--font-mono,monospace);letter-spacing:.1em;white-space:nowrap}.team-note-status i{width:.35rem;height:.35rem}
.team-close{padding:clamp(5rem,9vw,8rem) 0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 78% 55%,rgba(3,130,189,.18),transparent 43%),#07121d;border-top:1px solid var(--tp-line)}
.team-close h2{font-size:clamp(3rem,6vw,5.8rem)}.team-close-inner>p:not(.team-kicker){max-width:36rem;margin:1.3rem 0;color:var(--tp-muted);line-height:1.8}
.team-close a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:1.5rem;margin-top:1rem;padding:.9rem 1.25rem;border:1px solid rgba(90,185,180,.55);border-radius:99px;color:#d8f7f2;text-decoration:none;font-size:.82rem;transition:background .3s,border-color .3s}.team-close a:hover{background:rgba(90,185,180,.1);border-color:#5ab9b4}.team-close a span{color:#7fd1cb}
@keyframes team-morph{0%{border-radius:42% 58% 54% 46%/48% 42% 58% 52%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(-5deg)}100%{border-radius:57% 43% 42% 58%/39% 59% 41% 61%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(5deg)}}
@media(max-width:850px){.team-hero-grid,.team-approach-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.team-visual{min-height:27rem}.team-intro{max-width:44rem}.team-section-head{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1rem}.team-principle-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.team-principle:last-child{grid-column:1/-1;min-height:19rem}.team-note{grid-template-columns:3.5rem 1fr}.team-note-status{grid-column:2}}
@media(max-width:560px){.team-wrap{width:calc(100% - 2rem)}.team-hero{padding-top:3.5rem}.team-hero-grid{min-height:0}.team-intro h1,.team-close h2{font-size:clamp(2.8rem,13vw,4.2rem)}.team-visual{min-height:22rem}.team-orbit{width:14rem;height:14rem}.team-orbit-b{width:18rem;height:18rem}.team-orbit-c{width:22rem;height:22rem}.team-core{width:9.5rem;height:9.5rem}.team-core b{font-size:1.1rem}.team-node{font-size:.46rem;padding:.45rem .5rem}.team-node-a{left:3%;top:19%}.team-node-b{right:3%;top:24%}.team-node-c{left:28%;bottom:11%}.team-hero-bottom{gap:.5rem;font-size:.47rem}.team-principle-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.team-principle,.team-principle:last-child{grid-column:auto;min-height:20rem}.team-note{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.8rem;padding:1.2rem}.team-note-status{grid-column:auto}.team-section{padding:4.5rem 0}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.team-page *{animation:none!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}
</style>